### Easy Health API — Agendamentos (seção 21.6 do readme)
# Todas exigem autenticação.

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria.silva@email.com",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### Listar meus agendamentos (Home > Próximas Consultas / Histórico)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Criar agendamento (Tela "Agendar Consulta")
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agendamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "establishmentId": "hosp-sao-lucas",
  "especialidade": "Cardiologia",
  "data": "2026-09-20",
  "horario": "10:00"
}

### Detalhe de um agendamento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agendamentos/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Reagendar (mudar data/horário)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/agendamentos/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "horario": "11:30"
}

### Confirmar agendamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agendamentos/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}/confirmar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Cancelar agendamento
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/agendamentos/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
